			"notes": "Adds two new pylons, the Harvester Pylon and the Interdiction Pylon.\n\nHarvester pylon is placed in the water block for a farm, and harvests crops in a configurable radius (from 3x3 to 9x9) around the pylon.  Output goes to an inventory placed above the pylon. By default, the pylon requires a hoe in the pylon inventory, and will consume 1 durability per crop harvest.\n\nInterdiction pylon will block all spawns of a specific mob within the configured chunk range. Right click on a mob with a Mob Filter, then add the filter to the pylon inventory to block that mob.\n\nOther changes:\n- fix an issue where infusion pylons would be force-loaded the first time they were loaded by anyone, not just the owner."
		}
